    "resolvable": false,
    "notes": [
      {
        "id": 3954482927,
        "type": null,
        "body": "Planned as phase 2 of [Object save fixes and arm pricing](https://gitlab.com/max757/Luminari-Source/-/blob/master/docs/ongoing-projects/object-save-fixes-and-arm-pricing.md).\n\nIt runs after #19 and before #15, #16 and #17: their tests go into `unittests/CuTest/test_database_persistence.c` and are checked on databases built from `sql/master_schema.sql` alone, so every test in that file has to pass alone there first.\n\nIts `18-` branch is created from master when the phase starts. The work runs in the worktree `Luminari-Source-object-save-fixes-and-arm-pricing`, now on phase 1 (#19).",
        "author": {
          "id": 42759441,
          "username": "max757",
